05:48.375 --> 05:49.208
Oo nga.

05:55.208 --> 05:56.625
Mag-enjoy lang tayo!

05:56.708 --> 05:59.958
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

06:00.041 --> 06:03.166
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

